+"""Verified witness generator for arXiv:2504.12430.
+
+The generated task is proper (5:2)-fractional coloring of a graph, viewed as a
+2-uniform hypergraph.  A color is a 2-subset of {0,1,2,3,4}; adjacent vertices
+must receive disjoint subsets.  Generation plants a balanced coloring first and
+then samples a connected cubic graph whose edges are all proper under it.
